{
    "name": "tpa-Manchester-v1-0-0",
    "displayName": "TPA Manchester v1.0.0",
    "description": "Manchester team practices: 8 GitLab guarantees per member for commits, lines added and deleted, merge requests, comments, approvals and closed items. All guarantees are evaluated hourly with an objective of at least 1.",
